## Architecture Summary

```mermaid
graph TD
    subgraph CLI["CLI (main.rs)"]
        List["list"]
        Mux["mux"]
        Demux["demux"]
        Tray["tray"]
    end

    subgraph MuxModule["mux/"]
        MuxManager["manager.rs"]
        MuxRuntime["runtime.rs"]
        MuxModes["modes/"]
    end

    subgraph DemuxModule["demux/"]
        DemuxManager["manager.rs"]
        DemuxRuntime["runtime.rs"]
        DemuxModes["modes/"]
    end

    subgraph TrayModule["tray/"]
        TrayApp["app.rs"]
        TrayConfig["config.rs"]
        TrayState["state.rs"]
    end

    subgraph Utils["utils/"]
        Evdev["evdev.rs"]
        FF["ff.rs"]
        Gilrs["gilrs.rs"]
        Hide["hide.rs"]
    end

    Mux --> MuxManager
    Demux --> DemuxManager
    Tray --> TrayApp
    
    MuxManager --> MuxRuntime
    MuxRuntime --> MuxModes
    DemuxManager --> DemuxRuntime
    DemuxRuntime --> DemuxModes
    
    MuxManager --> Utils
    DemuxManager --> Utils
    TrayApp --> MuxManager
    TrayApp --> DemuxManager
```

