## File-by-File Breakdown

### Root Level

#### [main.rs](file:///home/ruffsl/git/ruffsl/CtrlAssist/src/main.rs) (271 lines)

**Purpose**: Application entry point and CLI command dispatcher.

**Key Components**:
- [Cli](file:///home/ruffsl/git/ruffsl/CtrlAssist/src/main.rs#18-22) struct: Clap-derived CLI parser with subcommands
- `Commands` enum: `List`, [Mux](file:///home/ruffsl/git/ruffsl/CtrlAssist/src/mux/modes/mod.rs#46-65), [Demux](file:///home/ruffsl/git/ruffsl/CtrlAssist/src/demux/modes/mod.rs#36-49), [Tray](file:///home/ruffsl/git/ruffsl/CtrlAssist/src/tray/state.rs#34-59)
- [MuxArgs](file:///home/ruffsl/git/ruffsl/CtrlAssist/src/main.rs#39-64)/[DemuxArgs](file:///home/ruffsl/git/ruffsl/CtrlAssist/src/main.rs#66-91): Argument structures for each mode
- `HideType` enum: `None`, `Steam`, `System`
- `SpoofTarget` enum: `Primary`, [Assist](file:///home/ruffsl/git/ruffsl/CtrlAssist/src/tray/app.rs#139-146), `None`

**Functions**:
| Function | Purpose |
|----------|---------|
| [main()](file:///home/ruffsl/git/ruffsl/CtrlAssist/src/main.rs#108-119) | Tokio async entry, routes to subcommands |
| [list_gamepads()](file:///home/ruffsl/git/ruffsl/CtrlAssist/src/main.rs#120-139) | Prints all detected controllers with IDs and paths |
| [run_mux(args)](file:///home/ruffsl/git/ruffsl/CtrlAssist/src/main.rs#140-214) | Starts mux session with signal handling |
| [run_demux(args)](file:///home/ruffsl/git/ruffsl/CtrlAssist/src/main.rs#215-271) | Starts demux session with signal handling |

