#### modes/[priority.rs](file:///home/ruffsl/git/ruffsl/CtrlAssist/src/mux/modes/priority.rs) (102 lines)

**Purpose**: Priority mode - Assist overrides Primary when active.

**Logic**:
- **Buttons**: Block Primary if Assist is holding same button
- **D-Pad**: Assist priority when active (above deadzone)
- **Triggers**: Maximum value from either controller
- **Sticks**: Assist priority when active (circular deadzone)

---

#### modes/[average.rs](file:///home/ruffsl/git/ruffsl/CtrlAssist/src/mux/modes/average.rs) (124 lines)

**Purpose**: Average mode - Blend inputs from both controllers.

**Logic**:
- **Buttons**: OR logic (either pressed = pressed)
- **D-Pad**: Average when both active
- **Triggers**: Average when both active
- **Sticks**: Average X/Y when both active

---

#### modes/[toggle.rs](file:///home/ruffsl/git/ruffsl/CtrlAssist/src/mux/modes/toggle.rs) (124 lines)

**Purpose**: Toggle mode - Switch active controller on demand.

**State**: `active_id: Option<GamepadId>`

**Logic**:
- Mode button on Assist toggles active controller
- Full state sync on toggle (buttons + axes)
- Only active controller's events are forwarded
- Reports active controller changes for FF routing

