#### modes/[unicast.rs](file:///home/ruffsl/git/ruffsl/CtrlAssist/src/demux/modes/unicast.rs) (127 lines)

**Purpose**: Unicast mode - Route to one active virtual at a time.

**State**: `active_index: usize`

**Logic**:
- Mode button cycles active virtual device
- Full state sync on switch
- Optional latching behavior (compile-time flag)
- Neutralizes previous device on switch (if latching disabled)

---

#### modes/[multicast.rs](file:///home/ruffsl/git/ruffsl/CtrlAssist/src/demux/modes/multicast.rs) (55 lines)

**Purpose**: Multicast mode - Route to all virtual devices.

**Logic**:
- Every event cloned to all virtual devices
- All virtuals considered active for FF

